.DS_Store
.claude/
.vscode/
worktrees/

# Core dumps. A killed distributed rank drops one of these in its CWD -- measured: a hung nvshmem
# arm reaped at its timeout left `core.pt_nccl_watchdg.<t>.<pid>` at **1.3 GB** in a worktree root,
# untracked and one `git add .` away from a commit nobody could push. The NCCL watchdog aborting on
# a hard kill is expected, so this will recur every time an experiment arm is reaped.
core.*

